# Deterministic wall-hug race probe for the MAC-RACE-CONTROL-01 blocker audit.
# Dev-harness input only (GDX_INPUT_SCRIPT drives the N64 pad seam in-process;
# no window focus required). NOT player input and NOT a completed-race claim.
# Holds accelerator + full-left stick for 90 s, then reports the resulting mode.
WAITTITLE 3600
PRESS START 3
WAITMODE 7 3600
WAIT 120
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 10 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 8 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 9 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 1 5400
LOG wallhug_probe_race_reached
INPUT A -80 0 5400
LOG wallhug_probe_segment_done
WAITMODE 15 3600
LOG wallhug_probe_saw_next_course
WAITMODE 18 3600
LOG wallhug_probe_saw_machine_settings
WAITMODE 1 5400
LOG wallhug_probe_saw_race_again
QUIT
